The encoder-only WebAssembly module is built from the pinned sources in
DEPENDENCIES.txt using scripts/jxl/build.sh and scripts/jxl/encoder.c. It
accepts 8-bit sRGB RGBA pixels. The public decoder API entry unit and Brotli
decoder archive are excluded from the final link. libjxl's encoder does use
some shared translation units with decoder-oriented names; these appear in
the link report because they also provide encoder helpers. The module reports
JxlEncoderVersion 0x0032C8 (13000 decimal).

